ion of contracts near the legal limit does not prove improper actions. It could reflect market conditions, budget constraints, or separate needs. Statistical patterns alone do not indicate wrongdoing without further investigation.\nWhat can be checked: Check the details of contract [1] to confirm the service type and if it aligns with the body’s needs. Review the distribution of contracts across awardees to see if any pattern suggests repeated requests for similar services. Ensure that contracts are for distinct services and not for the same purpose repeated over time.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["Hrjrs6l%2Br9170UvEyYJSGw%3D%3D","oUnnd4x58JbN3k3tjedSGw%3D%3D","16%2Bc14BgUq7ECtSnloz%2BZQ%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}